<title>JAPAN: Titan Kogyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Titan Kogyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.03		vs	    5.40</p>
<p> Operating   loss 163    million	  vs   loss 152    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 155    million	  vs   loss 175    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 170    million	  vs   loss 215    million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 6.49 yen	  vs     loss 8.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     26 million	  vs	  26 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Titan Kogyo Kabushiki Kaisha manufactures titanium oxide.</p>
